    <string name="diagnostics_pmtu_caution">QUIC DPLPMTUD measures outbound UDP payload bytes from this device to the selected server on this path. The ACK-confirmed value is a lower bound, not the exact path MTU. An ACK on the return path does not measure its PMTU. The configured ceiling and the interface MTU are separate values. A partial observation does not confirm a completed measurement.</string>
